  "content": "\n\n<p>Этот пак создан для тех, кто скучает по отсутствию Actions &amp; Stuff в Java (пока..), и ищет что-то, чтобы восполнить этот пробел. Это Java &amp; Stuff (одна из многих версий) — модпак, который переносит часть ключевых возможностей ANS.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/60ef0e6dd5a02340948789f3427cc5d6fb38fbe5.png\" alt=\"title\"></p>\n<h2>Если у вас есть вопросы или предложения, присоединяйтесь к нашему Discord!</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>В этот пак входят:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Плавная анимация сущностей</li>\n<li>Анимации игрока</li>\n<li>Анимации от первого лица</li>\n<li>Частицы</li>\n<li>Контур зачарований</li>\n<li>3D предметы</li>\n<li>Новые взрывы</li>\n<li>Шейдеры</li>\n<li>Моды для повышения производительности!</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Что включено</h2>\n<h3>Моды</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamic-fps\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dynamic FPS</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entity-model-features\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Model Features</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fentitytexturefeatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Entity Texture Features</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/entityculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">EntityCulling</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/explosive-enhancement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Explosive Enhancement</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ferritecore-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">FerriteCore</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hold-my-items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hold My Items</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immediatelyfast\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immediately Fast</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/irisshaders\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iris</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lithium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lithium</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moreculling\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Culling</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mouse-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mouse Tweaks</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-resource-pack-warnings\" rel=\"nofollow\">No Resource Pack Warnings</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/particular-reforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">Particular Reforged</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/text-placeholder-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Placeholder API</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sodium\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sodium</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visuality\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visuality</a></p>\n<h2>Наборы ресурсов</h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fbrays-better-enchanted-outlines\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bray's Better Enchantment Outlines</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/endl3sss-trident-remodel\" rel=\"nofollow\">Endl3ss's Trident Remodel</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffa-extensions-brays-chestfix\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA Extensions - Bray's Chest GUI Fix</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ffa-playerhmi\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Player &times; HMI Patches</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fresh Animations</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Creepers</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-emissive\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Emissive</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-objects\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Objects</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fa-player-extension\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Player Extension</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/fresh-animations-spiders\" rel=\"nofollow\">FA: Spiders</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252flow-fire-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Low Fire</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rays-3d-ladders\" rel=\"nofollow\">RAY's 3D Ladders</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/rays-3d-rails\" rel=\"nofollow\">RAY's 3D Rails</a>, <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252ftools-and-utils\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weskerson's 3D Items</a></p>\n<h2>Шейдеры</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/visual-vibrance\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visual Vibrance</a></p>",
